            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Steam Special Edition</strong> includes additional content by expanding on both the in-game and behind-the-scenes stories of Defense Grid 2, offering a visual novel experience that extends the campaign's narrative as well as art, soundtrack and making of insights. Purchasing or upgrading to the Special Edition includes: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If you purchase or upgrade to the Special Edition you will receive:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Matter of Endurance</strong> — A 30-minute audiobook featuring character voices and concept art from an original story by Hugo Award-winning author Mary Robinette Kowal, set between the events of <i>Defense Grid: Containment</i> and <i>Defense Grid 2</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense Grid 2 Original Soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Making of Defense Grid 2</strong> — A 312-page PDF by Russ Pitts, a reporter and author embedded with the development team throughout the full development cycle of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Art of Defense Grid</strong> — A 73-page PDF art book showcasing concept art from the development of the original <i>Defense Grid</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Art of Defense Grid 2</strong> — A 123-page PDF art book showcasing concept art from the development of <i>Defense Grid 2</i>.</p></li></ul>",
